\item OpenAI, \emph{Subset Sum in Time O(2\textasciicircum{}\{0.49n\})}, 2026-10-04; citation key \texttt{OAI:Subset-Sum-in-Time-2-power-0-49n-October-4-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Subset-Sum-in-Time-2-power-0-49n-October-4-2026/subset-sum.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Subset-Sum-in-Time-2-power-0-49n-October-4-2026/subset-sum.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Subset-Sum-in-Time-2-power-0-49n-October-4-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Subset-Sum-in-Time-2-power-0-49n-October-4-2026/subset-sum.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Subset-Sum-in-Time-2-power-0-49n-October-4-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex\#L58}{thm:main}.
